  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "H-hello, <U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿԃsirma’am! Would you like a ride anywhere?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048002D00680065006C006C006F002C002000100003110000FF0503007300690072006D006120190061006D002100200057006F0075006C006400200079006F00750020006C0069006B0065002000610020007200690064006500200061006E007900770068006500720065003F001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s actually my first day on the job, and I haven’t\ngotten a single passenger yet.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ve practiced plenty! I know what I’m doing! But\nI’ll be pretty nervous until I get used to things...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 107
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So please! Help me out here!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nLet me drive you somewhere—I promise I won’t\ncharge you anything!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tell me whenever you’re ready to put the pedal to\nthe metal!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540065006C006C0020006D00650020007700680065006E006500760065007200200079006F007520190072006500200072006500610064007900200074006F0020007000750074002000740068006500200070006500640061006C00200074006F000A0074006800650020006D006500740061006C0021001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Where can I take you in my taxi?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570068006500720065002000630061006E00200049002000740061006B006500200079006F007500200069006E0020006D007900200074006100780069003F001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No problem",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F002000700072006F0062006C0065006D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No thanks",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F0020007400680061006E006B00730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But...but you’d be doing me such a big favor!\nPlease, please let me take you somewhere!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Thank you so much! Gosh, my first-ever fare—\neven if I’m not charging you anything!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Magenta Pokémon Center",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006100670065006E0074006100200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002000430065006E0074006500720000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh... I’m not sure I can find any of those... Could\nyou maybe choose a different destination?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A-all right! Then let’s get going!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041002D0061006C006C00200072006900670068007400210020005400680065006E0020006C0065007420190073002000670065007400200067006F0069006E00670021001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I guess having only one destination makes this a\none-of-a-kind cab, don’t you think?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sorry if I sound flippant. I know I should be able\nto find more than one place without getting lost...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 107
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Um... Oh! You know the strawberry tarts at Café\nPokémon-Amie? I love those. They’re great.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh. Sorry... I guess I shouldn’t just talk about\nmyself and what I like, huh...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s sure gotten tough to drive through town with\nall these wild Pokémon everywhere, huh?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I bet that makes you want to ask why I bothered\nbecoming a taxi driver in the first place, right?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "GAH!!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004700410048002100210021001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "S-sorry. I missed a turn. We’re going to have to\ncircle back around now...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Um, right, so I was explaining why I became a taxi\ndriver.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006D002C002000720069006700680074002C00200073006F0020004900200077006100730020006500780070006C00610069006E0069006E006700200077006800790020004900200062006500630061006D00650020006100200074006100780069000A006400720069007600650072002E001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "AH!!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410048002100210021001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That’s it! There! We’ve arrived at your destination,\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿԃsirma’am: the Magenta Pokémon Center!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAs promised, you don’t owe me a thing.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 142
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Thanks for the ride",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680061006E006B007300200066006F00720020007400680065002000720069006400650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No, I’ll pay like normal",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F002C002000492019006C006C00200070006100790020006C0069006B00650020006E006F0072006D0061006C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No, no, I’m the one who should be thanking you!\nI appreciate you taking a chance on me!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "R-really...? But you don’t have to...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nWell, if you insist, then that’ll be <U+E300>710, please.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "R-really...? But you don’t have to...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nWell, if you insist, then that’ll be <U+E300>710, please.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nWait, you don’t even have that much anyway...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 145
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿 ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00200000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Well, my first fare taught me a lot. Like how far\nI’ve still got to go before I’m a true pro...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I got lost on the streets, got lost in conversation,\nand I think I totally lost your trust by the end...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 109
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But I do have one area where I’m still confident I\ncan impress you: Pokémon battles! How about it?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 5024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Please! You were my first-ever fare. Now let me\npay you back with a rewarding battle!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 5232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sure, why not?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 5412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053007500720065002C00200077006800790020006E006F0074003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’d rather not...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 5444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006400200072006100740068006500720020006E006F0074002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Great! I’ll show you that I’m not so hopeless at\neverything I do!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004700720065006100740021002000492019006C006C002000730068006F007700200079006F007500200074006800610074002000492019006D0020006E006F007400200073006F00200068006F00700065006C006500730073002000610074000A00650076006500720079007400680069006E00670020004900200064006F0021001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, please reconsider! I really want to show you\nmy skills!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 5620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002C00200070006C00650061007300650020007200650063006F006E007300690064006500720021002000490020007200650061006C006C0079002000770061006E007400200074006F002000730068006F007700200079006F0075000A006D007900200073006B0069006C006C00730021001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿)",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 5748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "OK, it turns out that battle taught me how far I’ve\nstill got to go as a Trainer too...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 5760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But that doesn’t mean it wasn’t fun! I really\nenjoyed battling with you!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 5944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m glad I’ve never given up on Pokémon battling.\nI’m not the best, but it still gives me confidence.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 6100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 106
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And if I don’t give up as a taxi driver, I bet I’ll build\nup confidence over time there too.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAs long as, um, I don’t lose my job or anything.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 6312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 149
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Thank you again for being my first-ever fare—and\nfor the great battle today!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 6612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    }
  ],
